  "externalBoundaries": [
    "Ordinary processed delivery is a deduplication record. Pending delivery is not exclusive, and a late ordinary failure may remove a row already completed by a concurrent handler.",
    "Opaque body parser validates method/path, actual bounded bytes, HMAC, strict JSON, nested event classification and command grammar before the model receives decoded fields.",
    "The receipt can record one queue message twice after lost acceptance acknowledgment. Review/appeal/value consumers retain their own identities and idempotent decisions.",
    "Installation ordered mutation and notices are intentionally separate; this model covers its webhook receipt and retry only.",
    "Current maintainer and GitHub item identity evidence may authorize exact reopen confirmation. Penalty reversal, cleanup and scope rechecks on GitHub are downstream."
